  "hints": [
    "Build an adjacency list `prereq -> [dependents]` and an `indegree` array of length num_courses.",
    "Use heapq (min-heap) initialized with all 0-indegree course IDs so whenever multiple courses are ready, the lowest ID is taken next (Kahn topological sort)!",
    "Pseudocode:\n  heap = [c for c in range(n) if indeg[c] == 0]; heapq.heapify(heap)\n  pop smallest, decrement neighbors, push new 0-indegrees; if len(order) != n return []"
